@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
title SHORT_TERM - Redis + Lua

actor Caller
participant IdempotencyExecutor as Executor
participant RedisIdempotencyRepository as Repo
database Redis

Caller -> Executor : execute(SHORT_TERM)
Executor -> Repo : tryAcquire
Repo -> Redis : EVAL try-acquire.lua\nread + decide + transition atomically
Redis --> Repo : ACQUIRED / SUCCESS / PROCESSING / FAILED

alt ACQUIRED
  Repo --> Executor : ACQUIRED
  Executor -> Executor : callback
  Executor -> Repo : markSuccess(owner, version)
  Repo -> Redis : EVAL mark-success.lua\ncompare owner/version + HSET + PEXPIRE
  Executor --> Caller : EXECUTED
else SUCCESS
  Repo --> Executor : SUCCESS + resultPayload
  Executor --> Caller : REPLAYED
end

... recordTtl expires ...
Redis -> Redis : key deleted automatically

note right of Redis
TTL 到期后同一个 Key 可以再次执行，
所以这是有限窗口去重，不是永久业务事实。
end note
@enduml
